msgid "Recognised by the exact fingerprint of the file (SHA-256)."
msgstr "Reconocido por la huella exacta del archivo (SHA-256)."

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:426
msgid ""
"The bytes of the file changed (typically document metadata rewritten while "
"it was emailed or re-saved), but its renderable content matches the "
"certified one exactly, page by page."
msgstr ""
"Los bytes del archivo han cambiado (normalmente, metadatos del documento "
"reescritos al enviarlo por correo o al reguardarlo), pero su contenido "
"visible coincide exactamente con el certificado, página a página."

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:529
msgid ""
"This platform is not configured with a public signing key. Certification "
"records are sealed with a symmetric HMAC that only the platform itself can "
"verify."
msgstr ""
"Esta plataforma no tiene configurada una clave pública de firma. Los "
"registros de certificación se sellan con un HMAC simétrico que solo la "
"propia plataforma puede verificar."

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:544
msgid ""
"The \"seal.signature\" field of a GEA certification record, over every other "
"field serialised as compact JSON with sorted keys, UTF-8."
msgstr ""
"El campo \"seal.signature\" de un registro de certificación de GEA, sobre "
"todos los demás campos serializados como JSON compacto con las claves "
"ordenadas, en UTF-8."

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:561
msgid "AEGIS Documents Certificates"
msgstr "Certificados de documentos AEGIS"

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:563
msgid ""
"Verify documents protected and issued through the AEGIS certification system."
msgstr ""
"Verifica documentos protegidos y emitidos a través del sistema de "
"certificación AEGIS."

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:571
msgid "IPCON Employee Certificate"
msgstr "Certificado de empleado IPCON"

#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\views.py:573
msgid "Validate employment and institutional certificates issued by IPCON."
msgstr ""
"Valida los certificados laborales e institucionales emitidos por IPCON."
